cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this pipeline, its SQLite relational schema, or its integrative species delimitation protocol (UNC-BOT-SOP-2026-04-REV5) in your research, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Automated Vegetative Phenotyping and Integrative Species Delimitation Pipeline for North American Packera"
version: "5.0.0"
